## Dependencies & Their Licenses

This application relies on third-party software. See [`THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`](THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md)
for the complete list of dependencies, their licenses, and notices.

## MinerU Integration

OmniMD ships with the official [MinerU](https://github.com/opendatalab/MinerU) engine
(`mineru-api` FastAPI service) as its sole document-to-Markdown parser. MinerU is
distributed under the **Apache License 2.0** with additional terms. When OmniMD
starts, it downloads the required MinerU models from official sources
(HuggingFace / ModelScope) — users must review and accept the model license
terms at download time.

MinerU license file must be placed alongside this file as `LICENSE.MinerU`
before distributing OmniMD in any form.

